OL,3,GNEWSAMP criticises council 'inaction'
OL,4,Aover fire-hit mill
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has warned "the status quo cannot
OL,7,Fcontinue" after another suspected arson
OL,8,Fattack at a landmark former mill in
OL,9,FKeighley.
OL,11,FThe blaze on Tuesday at the derelict
OL,12,FDalton Mills site was believed to be a
OL,13,F"deliberate ignition", according to
OL,14,FWest Yorkshire Fire Service.
OL,16,FThree crews attended the site - which
OL,17,Fhas been the backdrop for TV dramas
OL,18,Flike Peaky Blinders and Downton Abbey -
OL,19,Fand found a wagon on fire, a fire
OL,20,Fservice spokesperson said.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
