OL,3,GNEWSAMP criticises council 'inaction'
OL,4,Aover fire-hit mill
OL,5,
OL,6,FKeighley and Ilkley MP Robbie Moore
OL,7,Fsaid residents and local businesses
OL,8,Fwere repeatedly being put at risk by
OL,9,FBradford Council's "refusal to secure
OL,10,Fthe Dalton Mills site properly" despite
OL,11,Fa series of arson attacks. The council
OL,12,Fhas been approached for comment.
